cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BangladeshiVQA, please cite the paper and dataset."
title: "BangladeshiVQA: Evaluating Geo-Cultural and Tiered Multimodal Reasoning in Bangladeshi Context"
abstract: >-
  A culturally grounded Bangla Visual Question Answering benchmark of 2,068 Bangladeshi
  images and 7,038 open-ended question-answer pairs across three cognitive levels
  (Perception, Representation, Cognition) and seven image categories. The first Bangla VQA
  dataset with dedicated in-image Bangla scene-text (OCR) questions and leak-free
  image-ID-based splits.
